{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11301480","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11301480","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1130148001:1":{"text":"もちろんだ。ソーンとアルサは負けたことがないんだからな。","source_cn":"那当然，因为索恩和阿尔萨从来就没有失败过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30DE4EF6122499CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130148002:1":{"text":"商隊の奴らが一番よく挙げてた名前は、俺たちウール族じゃないが……","source_cn":"虽然商队现在谈论最多的还不是他们和我们乌尔氏族——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x802D65449EFB1260","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130148003:1":{"text":"この戦歌祭が終わったら、きっとソーンとアルサの名前を口々に称えるだろうよ。","source_cn":"但这届战歌节之后，他们一定会传颂索恩和阿尔萨的名字。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5B46629AE11BBF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:小蛮血阿米库":{"text":"ババリアのアミク","source":"小蛮血阿米库","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}